# Regenerated results: everything `make figures` produces lands at the top
# level of figures/ and is removed by `make clean`. These are derived from
# data/ and should not be committed. The submitted PDFs in figures/reference/
# and the hand-drawn schematics in figures/schematics/ are kept (single-star
# patterns below do not descend into those subdirectories).
figures/_template_work/
figures/*.pdf
figures/*.png
figures/*.txt
figures/*.json
